1182	  // calls poll_until_clear(busy) before returning, so by the time the cmderr
1183	  // check runs, busy is already clear. This test pins that contract: between
1184	  // every kCommand write and the next kAbstractcs read, the recorded ops
1185	  // must include at least one kAbstractcs read (the busy poll). If a future
1186	  // refactor regresses by removing the chained poll, this test fails.
